和扭曲的效果。逆光勾勒出她的轮廓，柔和的光斑与深蓝色背景交相辉映，\\n营造出水下呼吸般的幻象。她的表情冷艳，仿佛一座光滑的陶瓷娃娃，散发出压抑、破碎的氛围，赛博风与科幻元素交织，\\n仿佛置身于一个金属质感的超现实世界，弥漫着孤独与压迫感。\", \"season\": \"冬季\", \"actions\": [\"upsample_subtle\", \"upsample_creative\", \"low_variation\", \"high_variation\", \"zoom_out_2x\", \"zoom_out_1_5x\", \"pan_left\", \"pan_right\", \"pan_up\", \"pan_down\"], \"success\": true, \"task_id\": \"526abe3d-c2ca-4529-9d88-bf162306e87f\", \"image_id\": \"1452263565661569024\", \"progress\": 100, \"trace_id\": \"3dbb3248-c6aa-4302-b13f-10ad9fe73769\", \"image_url\": \"https://platform.cdn.zhishuyun.com/midjourney/526abe3d-c2ca-4529-9d88-bf162306e87f.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/!50p\", \"image_width\": 512, \"patternName\": \"一颗镶满珍珠的南瓜灯-女孩-015058\", \"image_height\": 512, \"raw_image_url\": \"https://platform.cdn.zhishuyun.com/midjourney/526abe3d-c2ca-4529-9d88-bf162306e87f.png\", \"sub_image_urls\": [], \"targetAudience\": \"成人\", \"raw_image_width\": 1024, \"raw_image_height\": 1024}','APPROVED','2025-12-21 19:37:20',1991067449709658113,'管理员自动过审',0,'2025-12-21 11:37:20','2025-12-21 11:37:20',0),(2002939722221494274,1991067449709658113,'Pink and gray f-953496','Pink and gray floral dress on model, simple design, floral pattern, light blue fabric dress with a flower on top of the left side, crossing from both sides of the upper body, plain background, highlighting the simplicity of the details, white studio lighting for product photography, clean, minimal, modern and elegant aesthetics. –v 6.1 –ar 3:4','MJ_GENERATED',NULL,'https://platform.cdn.zhishuyun.com/midjourney/10cb4d1f-a428-4767-b5f2-db20f00c5fbd.png','https://platform.cdn.zhishuyun.com/midjourney/10cb4d1f-a428-4767-b5f2-db20f00c5fbd.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/!50p',NULL,NULL,'可爱','冬季','青少年','{\"style\": \"可爱\", \"prompt\": \"Pink and gray floral dress on model, simple design, floral pattern, light blue fabric dress with a flower on top of the left side, crossing from both sides of the upper body, plain background, highlighting the simplicity of the